      "id": "18470",
      "key": "SFCC-240",
      "summary": "Spike: Figma-to-React Implementation Workflow",
      "description": "Following the handover of the initial Figma-to-React workflow, this story covers the implementation of refinements to ensure the process is consistent, efficient, and scalable across all in-scope page templates and components throughout the build phase.\nThis includes addressing any gaps or friction points identified during initial application of the workflow, confirming component naming conventions, validating design token mapping, and finalising the handoff checklist to be followed by both the UX and frontend development teams.\nGoal\n\n\nTo deliver a fully refined and standardised Figma-to-React handoff workflow that is consistently applied by the full project team across all build sprints.",
