      "content": {
        "value": "Leave Tracker\n-------------\n\nTo help the team stay organised and ensure we have good visibility across availability, we have a leave tracker set up for the core delivery team. This includes both public holidays relevant to your location as well as any planned personal leave.\n\nAll core team members are asked to keep the tracker up to date by logging any upcoming leave as early as possible. This helps the team plan ahead, avoid scheduling conflicts, and ensure we're not caught off guard during key project milestones.\n\nIf you have any leave coming up - whether it's a public holiday, annual leave, or any other time off - please make sure it's reflected in the tracker.\n\nPlease see below the latest leave tracker:\n\nPublic Holidays (Australia - NSW and VIC)\n-----------------------------------------\n\n| **Date** | **Day** | **Holiday** | **NSW** | **VIC** |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 28/09/2026 | Mon | King's Birthday |  |  |\n| 5/10/2026 | Mon | Labour Day | ✓ |  |\n| 5/10/2026 | Mon | King's Birthday |  |  |\n| 3/11/2026 | Tue | Melbourne Cup |  | ✓ |\n| TBC | Fri | Friday before AFL Grand Final |  | ✓ |\n| 24/12/2026 | Thu | Christmas Eve (7pm-midnight) |  |  |\n| 24/12/2026 | Thu | Christmas Eve (6pm-midnight) |  |  |\n| 25/12/2026 | Fri | Christmas Day | ✓ | ✓ |\n| 26/12/2026 | Sat | Boxing Day / Proclamation Day | ✓ | ✓ |\n| 28/12/2026 | Mon | Additional Boxing Day | ✓ | ✓ |\n| 31/12/2026 | Thu | New Year's Eve (7pm-midnight) |  |  |\n| 1/01/2027 | Fri | New Year's Day | ✓ | ✓ |\n| 26/01/2027 | Tue | Australia Day | ✓ | ✓ |\n\nPublic Holidays (Philippines)\n-----------------------------\n\n| **Date** | **Day** | **Holiday** | **Note** |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 19/08/2026 | Wed | Manuel Luis Quezon Day | Quezon City-specific - not all team members can take this |\n| 21/08/2026 | Fri | Ninoy Aquino Day |  |\n| 31/08/2026 | Mon | National Heroes Day |  |\n| 9/09/2026 | Wed | Sergio Osmeña, Sr. Day | Cebu City-specific - not al